WEBVTT

00:19.985 --> 00:22.044
Chelsea and Ruri's Room
Stay out!

00:24.623 --> 00:27.387
Chelsea and Ruri's Room
Stay out!

00:32.364 --> 00:33.126
All right!

00:33.999 --> 00:35.023
What?

00:35.100 --> 00:37.432
You're heading out
this early in the morning?

00:37.502 --> 00:38.127
Yeah.

00:44.109 --> 00:46.304
I haven't seen you
dressed like that in a while.

00:47.979 --> 00:49.378
By the way, Rumina.

00:49.448 --> 00:51.575
Aren't you going to take
that kid with glasses?

00:53.552 --> 00:54.644
Ginnosuke...

00:57.355 --> 01:00.381
It could get pretty dicey
down there...

01:00.459 --> 01:02.359
...so I told him that he should...

01:03.095 --> 01:04.187
Just as I expected.

01:06.064 --> 01:07.122
Ginnosuke!

01:07.199 --> 01:09.963
I can see right through you, Rumina!

01:10.202 --> 01:12.363
You wouldn't leave me here,
would you?

01:13.772 --> 01:14.739
Oh, boy...

01:15.207 --> 01:17.198
We're on our way, Gramps!

01:17.909 --> 01:20.844
Don't you come home crying.

01:20.912 --> 01:22.277
Give me a break.

01:28.487 --> 01:31.456
I guess he's a sucker
for a pretty girl.

01:35.927 --> 01:40.421
The abandoned subway line
leads into darkness.

01:41.032 --> 01:43.626
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

01:44.369 --> 01:47.964
...beneath Tokyo, this nation's capital...

01:48.840 --> 01:52.469
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

01:52.978 --> 01:56.812
The name of this world where
the sun does not shine is...

02:19.838 --> 02:23.467
The city at night is so cold

02:23.542 --> 02:27.137
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

02:27.212 --> 02:30.579
I wonder if I can keep going

02:30.649 --> 02:33.174
The important thing...

02:33.285 --> 02:35.446
You must tell me

02:35.520 --> 02:37.044
Please

02:37.389 --> 02:42.122
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

02:42.194 --> 02:47.689
Tell me that's not true

02:47.766 --> 02:51.532
I loved you so much that it hurt

02:51.603 --> 02:55.130
Everything was sparkling all around

02:55.207 --> 02:58.540
There was nothing to be afraid of

02:58.610 --> 03:02.341
I believed in that

03:02.414 --> 03:05.975
That moment when
my passions stirred

03:06.051 --> 03:09.509
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

03:09.588 --> 03:12.989
I will never forget that moment

03:13.058 --> 03:16.494
I will never say I want to go back

03:16.561 --> 03:22.557
I just want to see you one more time

03:36.548 --> 03:39.184
Charge into the Underground
Charge into the Underground

03:39.184 --> 03:43.120
Charge into the Underground

03:52.197 --> 03:54.392
I'll take you to a flower garden!

03:54.466 --> 03:55.490
I promise!

03:56.268 --> 03:57.200
Ruri.

03:57.702 --> 04:00.830
Would you like to see
a real flower garden?

04:03.041 --> 04:04.201
Rumina...

04:04.609 --> 04:05.541
Chelsea...

04:07.779 --> 04:08.837
Excuse me!

04:09.748 --> 04:13.707
As of today I'll be
your bodyguard!

04:13.919 --> 04:15.443
My name is Chelsea Rorec.

04:15.553 --> 04:17.043
It will be a pleasure to serve you!

04:17.289 --> 04:19.154
Ch-Chel...

04:21.693 --> 04:22.717
Surprised?

04:23.194 --> 04:26.254
To think I'd end up becoming
bodyguard to the Maiden.

04:26.331 --> 04:28.925
The Company sure must be
short on staff.

04:39.077 --> 04:40.237
This is...

04:40.679 --> 04:42.579
It's a subway rail yard.

04:43.381 --> 04:47.112
Hey, is there really an entrance
to the Underground around here?

04:47.585 --> 04:48.347
Yeah.

04:48.620 --> 04:52.147
Just up ahead, there's a tunnel
from an abandoned subway line.

04:57.963 --> 04:59.658
There it is...

05:03.501 --> 05:06.231
Ruri's somewhere
deep in this darkness.

05:07.305 --> 05:08.135
All right!

05:09.207 --> 05:09.969
Let's go!

05:13.011 --> 05:14.569
Uh, you're...

05:16.648 --> 05:18.115
Who were you again?

05:19.317 --> 05:20.443
Maiden!

05:20.518 --> 05:24.352
Don't you remember when I almost killed
you on that playground on the surface?

05:26.958 --> 05:30.587
Mind you, that wind user
interrupted me back then.

05:31.496 --> 05:32.428
Rumina...

05:36.167 --> 05:37.498
Well, anyway...

05:38.336 --> 05:42.636
I guess it figures the Maiden of Life
would have a nice room.

05:42.707 --> 05:44.470
I sure am jealous.

05:44.776 --> 05:45.538
I...

05:46.978 --> 05:50.573
I prefer the surface much better.

05:56.821 --> 05:59.483
You should forget about
the surface world.

05:59.557 --> 06:00.649
By now...

06:00.725 --> 06:04.491
...I'm sure they've forgotten
about you and are doing just fine.

06:06.831 --> 06:11.200
But even if those two were
to come and try to take you back...

06:11.703 --> 06:12.192
Huh?

06:13.004 --> 06:16.701
Pairon wouldn't
let them get away with it.

06:17.208 --> 06:20.644
Besides, they can't get into
the Underground so easily.

06:23.882 --> 06:27.750
I mean, there's no one
foolish enough to risk his life...

06:27.819 --> 06:29.810
...in order to help a stranger.

06:33.691 --> 06:35.716
But this sure is a nice room!

06:35.794 --> 06:37.284
And your bed is so soft!

06:37.462 --> 06:39.828
Oh, come on.
Wipe that frown off your face.

06:40.298 --> 06:41.128
What's your...

06:41.199 --> 06:41.756
Huh?

06:42.867 --> 06:44.027
What's your name?

06:44.869 --> 06:45.597
Me?

06:47.138 --> 06:49.766
I'm Shiel. Shiel Messiah.

06:50.842 --> 06:52.139
I'm Ruri.

06:52.577 --> 06:53.839
Ruri Sarasa.

06:57.982 --> 07:00.280
I was pretty excited about
charging into this...

07:00.351 --> 07:03.149
...but how much longer
do we have to go?

07:06.758 --> 07:09.386
How much further, Blondie?

07:11.262 --> 07:12.126
We're here!

07:12.430 --> 07:13.556
F-Finally!

07:19.270 --> 07:21.363
I-It's a dead end!

07:21.639 --> 07:22.628
That's right.

07:22.707 --> 07:25.540
The Underground is behind that?

07:25.610 --> 07:26.099
Yes.

07:26.611 --> 07:28.238
All right, then!

07:29.047 --> 07:31.140
Let's smash through this gate!

07:31.783 --> 07:32.772
Hold it!

07:32.851 --> 07:35.411
We'll attract the attention
of the Company!

07:36.855 --> 07:39.847
Besides, if it was that easy
to get through...

07:39.924 --> 07:42.791
...it would've been easy to escape
to the surface in the first place.

07:42.927 --> 07:44.189
That's true.

07:45.063 --> 07:47.361
Hey, this isn't the time
to be laughing.

07:47.732 --> 07:49.256
So, what're we going to do?

07:50.201 --> 07:51.691
This is what we'll do.

08:01.946 --> 08:02.810
What's that?

08:03.148 --> 08:06.174
It's a device that unlocks the gate.

08:06.251 --> 08:07.912
Only a few people
in the Company...

08:07.986 --> 08:11.149
...know what the password is.

08:11.456 --> 08:14.084
People like the bodyguard
of the Maiden of Life.

08:14.159 --> 08:15.990
So let's just give it a go.

08:19.164 --> 08:20.028
Hey...

08:20.231 --> 08:21.323
That's funny.

08:21.533 --> 08:23.626
Maybe it's another password.

08:34.812 --> 08:37.576
Who changed the codes?!

08:39.217 --> 08:42.277
I'm going to smash it!

08:42.353 --> 08:44.480
Hey! I thought we didn't want
attract their attention!

08:44.989 --> 08:46.422
Shut up! Let's go!

08:46.991 --> 08:48.618
I agree with Rumina.

08:53.531 --> 08:55.123
Just take it easy, Blondie!

08:55.200 --> 08:56.724
What am I supposed to do?

08:56.801 --> 08:58.200
Um...

08:59.304 --> 09:01.568
Leave this one to me.

09:08.746 --> 09:11.681
Pairon, we have intruders
from the surface.

09:11.749 --> 09:14.149
They're trying the main gate.

09:14.586 --> 09:16.053
So they've already come.

09:16.120 --> 09:17.246
Such fools.

09:17.555 --> 09:18.783
What should we do?

09:19.490 --> 09:20.422
Leave them alone.

09:21.125 --> 09:24.424
There's no way they can
decode that password.

09:29.734 --> 09:30.996
I see.

09:31.069 --> 09:34.061
This is a Pentagon-class
security system.

09:34.138 --> 09:35.070
Pentagon?

09:35.139 --> 09:38.074
I'm talking about the
U.S. Department of Defense.

09:38.643 --> 09:39.735
N-No way!

09:40.645 --> 09:41.805
Pairon!

09:41.879 --> 09:44.541
The intruders have accessed
the main computer...

09:44.616 --> 09:46.982
...and are decoding the password!

09:47.518 --> 09:48.951
Override the system!

09:49.120 --> 09:49.711
Yes, sir!

09:52.323 --> 09:53.347
Let's see...

09:53.424 --> 09:57.155
Let's see... if I can re-route that...
and bypass this...

09:57.228 --> 09:58.320
And then...

10:17.215 --> 10:19.183
Whoa!
You did it, Ginnosuke!

10:19.250 --> 10:20.774
I'm impressed, nerdy guy!

10:21.319 --> 10:24.288
Oh, my computer...

10:28.226 --> 10:31.059
I will avenge you!

10:31.396 --> 10:33.023
Ginnosuke, hurry up!

10:33.097 --> 10:34.428
Yeah, I'm coming.

10:35.700 --> 10:36.530
Here I am.

10:36.601 --> 10:37.898
All right. Let's go!

10:41.706 --> 10:42.695
The gate...!

10:50.114 --> 10:52.548
I-It closed!

10:52.684 --> 10:54.174
Yeah, looks like it.

10:54.385 --> 10:55.374
H-Hang on...!

10:55.720 --> 10:59.315
The Company wouldn't be
stupid enough to leave it open.

11:01.125 --> 11:03.616
What are we going to do
when we want to leave?!

11:03.695 --> 11:06.596
When that time comes, we'll be
busting through everything.

11:06.664 --> 11:08.461
But not until we rescue Ruri.

11:09.000 --> 11:10.058
Oh, boy...

11:10.468 --> 11:12.163
You two sure are spirited.

11:13.371 --> 11:15.168
Hey, wait for me!

11:16.107 --> 11:17.938
The main gate has been shut!

11:18.109 --> 11:20.942
But the intruders have
managed to get in!

11:21.512 --> 11:22.877
We have no choice.

11:23.081 --> 11:24.673
Open Gate K.

11:24.749 --> 11:26.011
Gate K?!

11:27.518 --> 11:30.544
Pairon, you're going to let out
the Kelberos?

11:33.324 --> 11:34.689
If we let it loose...

11:34.759 --> 11:37.319
...there will be huge casualties
among the civilians!

11:37.729 --> 11:38.661
I don't care!

11:41.132 --> 11:41.962
Yes, sir.

11:42.033 --> 11:43.398
Open Gate K!

11:43.668 --> 11:44.862
Open Gate K!

11:45.103 --> 11:49.039
Access code P406, GK 789!

11:58.649 --> 12:00.378
So this is the Underground.

12:00.918 --> 12:04.684
The space below Tokyo,
below the streets we all walk.

12:06.491 --> 12:09.824
All right! Now let's find Ruri!

12:10.128 --> 12:12.187
We can't head in there directly.

12:12.430 --> 12:12.919
Huh?

12:13.965 --> 12:18.026
This place is a lot more complex
than you think it is.

12:18.236 --> 12:21.967
There are layers of buildings
throughout the Underground.

12:22.540 --> 12:24.440
How big is this place?

12:25.042 --> 12:25.940
I don't know.

12:26.010 --> 12:27.034
What?!

12:27.111 --> 12:29.011
You lived here!

12:29.213 --> 12:31.408
In order to protect itself...

12:31.482 --> 12:33.780
...the Company can quickly
reorganize the Underground's pathways...

12:33.851 --> 12:35.250
...into different patterns.

12:35.319 --> 12:38.015
And these patterns
are never the same.

12:38.089 --> 12:40.887
In other words, even I can
never know...

12:40.958 --> 12:42.789
...the correct location of things.

12:42.860 --> 12:45.226
It's like an RPG dungeon.

12:46.097 --> 12:50.124
So you don't know how we're
going to get to the Company?

12:50.201 --> 12:50.826
That's right.

12:51.269 --> 12:52.759
You're useless!

12:52.837 --> 12:54.896
If you don't like it,
just turn around and go home.

12:54.972 --> 12:55.904
Look, you!

12:55.973 --> 12:58.567
You acted like you knew
where we were going!

12:58.643 --> 13:00.804
I didn't say anything about
how to get there.

13:00.878 --> 13:01.435
You did!

13:01.512 --> 13:02.001
I did not!

13:02.079 --> 13:02.511
You did!

13:02.580 --> 13:02.978
I did not!

13:03.815 --> 13:05.942
They sure are spirited.

13:13.991 --> 13:14.980
That's...!

13:18.262 --> 13:20.355
Wh-What is this monster?!

13:20.431 --> 13:23.093
Are Underground animals
all big like this?!

13:23.167 --> 13:24.634
Or is that the famous Dragon?

13:24.702 --> 13:26.135
You're wrong on both counts!

13:26.370 --> 13:29.533
This is like the goon
of the Underground.

13:29.607 --> 13:31.541
Genetically developed
by the Company!

13:31.609 --> 13:33.099
He's called the Kelberos.

13:35.379 --> 13:36.277
Kelberos!

13:36.447 --> 13:38.779
He seems pretty tough!

13:39.150 --> 13:41.141
We can't fight him off!

13:41.219 --> 13:42.049
Let's run!

13:42.286 --> 13:42.911
Run?!

13:43.588 --> 13:44.953
You've got to be kidding!

13:45.022 --> 13:48.014
How are we supposed to get
anywhere if we run away?!

13:48.092 --> 13:50.060
Fine then.
Let's go, nerdy guy.

13:50.127 --> 13:52.459
My name's Ginnosuke!

13:53.731 --> 13:54.595
H-Hey!

13:57.668 --> 14:00.364
I'll show you the
Asagi sword style!

14:02.940 --> 14:05.170
I can't fight in this small space.

14:05.243 --> 14:06.608
I need more space!

14:09.313 --> 14:10.803
Rumina, this way!

14:12.817 --> 14:14.114
Chelsea!

14:14.185 --> 14:15.846
I'll take care of it!

14:25.062 --> 14:26.529
Yeah!

14:28.900 --> 14:29.867
It's going to collapse!

14:29.934 --> 14:31.094
Let's get out of here!

14:34.906 --> 14:36.897
Can't you move any faster?

14:36.974 --> 14:38.236
I'm trying!

14:38.643 --> 14:40.838
Don't try to cop a feel
in the middle of this!

14:40.912 --> 14:42.402
Why would I do that?!

14:43.014 --> 14:44.003
There...

14:44.849 --> 14:46.009
Oh, boy...

14:48.286 --> 14:49.514
What's that light?

14:51.255 --> 14:53.519
It's like sunlight.

14:53.925 --> 14:56.826
Did we work our way back
to the surface?

14:56.894 --> 14:57.588
No.

14:59.163 --> 15:00.289
That light...

15:03.768 --> 15:06.100
Wh-What is this?

15:07.872 --> 15:09.533
This is the Underground?

15:09.941 --> 15:13.308
You sure we didn't end up
back on the surface?

15:13.878 --> 15:15.368
No, we didn't.

15:15.613 --> 15:16.102
Huh?

15:18.916 --> 15:20.508
Wh-What is that?

15:20.851 --> 15:22.478
It looks like a movie set.

15:23.821 --> 15:28.554
So, I've ended up returning
to the world under this light.

15:32.263 --> 15:35.096
Chelsea, what are those lights?

15:35.399 --> 15:38.129
The Company provides
the people who live here...

15:38.202 --> 15:41.103
...with an electric light source...

15:41.172 --> 15:43.572
...that serves the same purpose
as the sun.

15:43.808 --> 15:47.904
It nurtures plant life which
provides food to the people here.

15:47.979 --> 15:49.378
Are those vegetable fields?

15:49.480 --> 15:51.914
There's tomatoes and cucumbers,
and wheat.

15:52.416 --> 15:53.906
With electricity and light...

15:53.985 --> 15:57.421
...the Company is able to exercise
total control over the people...

15:57.488 --> 15:59.422
...in the Underground.

16:00.324 --> 16:01.814
That's not right!

16:01.892 --> 16:04.588
Let's wipe out the Company
while we're at it!

16:04.662 --> 16:06.562
Wipe out the Company?!

16:08.499 --> 16:10.524
You must be a surface dweller!

16:10.601 --> 16:12.364
Yeah. What about it?

16:12.436 --> 16:14.233
You evil surface dweller!

16:14.305 --> 16:15.329
Stay out of our village!

16:15.406 --> 16:18.967
You're from the Company!
Why don't you get those two?!

16:20.478 --> 16:22.946
You must be a traitor!

16:23.714 --> 16:25.272
You can't trust a traitor!

16:25.349 --> 16:28.250
Get out of here,
evil surface dwellers!

16:28.319 --> 16:30.480
That's right! Get out of here!

16:30.755 --> 16:32.154
Stop that, you guys!

16:32.223 --> 16:33.485
That's dangerous!

16:35.426 --> 16:36.222
You!

16:36.327 --> 16:39.728
I'm not going to go easy on you
just because you're kids!

16:40.197 --> 16:42.222
We're being attacked
by a surface dweller!

16:42.299 --> 16:43.766
Let's get out of here!

16:44.802 --> 16:46.929
Hold it, you brats!

16:47.571 --> 16:48.538
Oh, boy...

16:51.909 --> 16:53.536
Well, what a surprise.

16:54.945 --> 16:58.608
To think someone would come
here from the surface world.

16:58.683 --> 17:01.174
What unusual guests.

17:01.318 --> 17:04.151
Please don't be bothered
by what those kids said.

17:04.789 --> 17:06.780
All the children in this village...

17:06.857 --> 17:09.291
...are convinced that
the Company are the good guys...

17:09.360 --> 17:12.488
...that are going to fight
the evil surface dwellers.

17:13.030 --> 17:15.396
That's right.
The people in the Underground...

17:15.466 --> 17:17.730
...hate the people who live
on the surface, right?

17:17.968 --> 17:20.596
But Rumina doesn't seem to
understand that.

17:21.105 --> 17:24.074
It is true that thanks to
the surface people...

17:24.141 --> 17:26.439
...we ended up abandoned here.

17:28.045 --> 17:31.481
But that's something only
a few people are responsible for.

17:31.549 --> 17:34.450
Not everyone from the surface is bad.

17:34.952 --> 17:37.443
Most people seem to understand that.

17:37.788 --> 17:40.120
No one's thinking of revenge.

17:40.458 --> 17:42.926
We all just want to live in peace.

17:43.294 --> 17:47.355
But no one can go against
the wishes of the Company.

17:50.267 --> 17:51.029
That's right.

17:51.168 --> 17:55.036
We wouldn't be able to live
without the Company, after all.

17:59.710 --> 18:01.075
But still...

18:01.378 --> 18:05.405
...I'm tired of seeing people
hate each other so much.

18:06.050 --> 18:09.144
Tired of seeing people
hate each other so much.

18:13.958 --> 18:15.789
Damn! Those brats!

18:15.860 --> 18:17.191
Where did they go?!

18:19.196 --> 18:20.356
I'll get you again!

18:20.431 --> 18:21.557
You're stupid!

18:21.632 --> 18:23.293
Why, you!

18:24.535 --> 18:26.127
You're pretty careless!

18:26.203 --> 18:27.534
Look, you!

18:27.605 --> 18:29.596
You're not getting away with this!

18:29.673 --> 18:31.231
Shut up, stupid!

18:33.310 --> 18:34.140
No way!

18:34.945 --> 18:36.913
The Kelberos! It's still alive!

18:39.383 --> 18:40.748
Aru! Mei!

18:42.219 --> 18:43.208
Hey!

18:44.221 --> 18:46.280
You wanna fight someone?!
Come and get me!

18:57.067 --> 18:58.728
I'll show you this time!

18:58.803 --> 19:00.532
My true power!

19:03.407 --> 19:04.965
Here goes!

19:06.143 --> 19:10.239
The Asagi Style Gale Force Wind!

19:32.169 --> 19:33.500
Ow...

19:35.406 --> 19:36.737
What'd you think?

19:36.807 --> 19:38.707
I'm not so bad after all, huh?

19:38.776 --> 19:39.868
How dare you...

19:41.412 --> 19:45.371
How dare you bring
such a monster with you!

19:46.016 --> 19:47.347
What're you talking about?!

19:47.418 --> 19:48.908
That's not it at all!

19:48.986 --> 19:51.420
I knew the surface dwellers
were evil!

19:51.488 --> 19:52.921
Get out of here!

19:52.990 --> 19:54.218
Wait! You guys!

19:54.291 --> 19:56.122
You've got it all wrong!

19:56.694 --> 19:57.388
Damn!

19:58.128 --> 20:02.531
Those kids think we surface
dwellers are all evil.

20:05.603 --> 20:08.367
They'd understand if they could
come to the surface.

20:22.152 --> 20:26.452
That wind user kid
and the traitor Chelsea Rorec...

20:26.891 --> 20:30.827
No matter what powers you may
have, you're no match for me.

20:31.161 --> 20:34.324
No match for my
magnetic power!

20:44.408 --> 20:49.141
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.213 --> 20:55.118
As if I have a purpose

20:55.219 --> 21:07.393
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.432 --> 21:19.275
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.343 --> 21:31.016
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.655 --> 21:40.495
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.564 --> 21:44.330
I tried to listen

21:44.401 --> 21:52.536
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.609 --> 22:01.677
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.361 --> 22:12.329
Preview

22:13.664 --> 22:15.256
I sure don't appreciate this.

22:15.332 --> 22:17.664
How dare they treat us like that.

22:17.968 --> 22:20.801
How could they think that
every surface dweller is evil?

22:21.472 --> 22:22.166
What?!

22:22.239 --> 22:23.069
It's gone!

22:23.140 --> 22:25.040
My Kogarasumaru!

22:25.109 --> 22:26.041
Damn!

22:26.110 --> 22:30.137
What if some agent of the
Company comes after us now?!

22:31.281 --> 22:33.875
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:33.951 --> 22:35.652
..."The Traps Hidden in the Darkness".

22:35.652 --> 22:36.854
The Traps Hidden in the Darkness
..."The Traps Hidden in the Darkness".

22:36.854 --> 22:40.255
The Traps Hidden in the Darkness
